        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential is delighted to present 11 Kenure Lawns to the Rush property market, a unique and versatile property comprising a beautifully maintained three-bedroom family home together with a substantial, fully plumbed and wired property to the rear.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned in the heart of Rush, this property offers an excellent opportunity for buyers seeking a turnkey home with the added benefit of a separate and highly versatile additional space.\r\n\r\nThe main residence is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising an entrance hall, bright living room, a spacious kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this property is the substantial second home located to the rear. Fully plumbed and wired, the accommodation comprises a large open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, a spacious bedroom, bathroom and walk-in wardrobe. This versatile space offers a range of potential uses, subject to PP.\r\n\r\nI note that subject to planning permission, there is the option to combine these properties to create one larger property.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from a private driveway providing valuable off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional, situated within a mature residential development and within walking distance of Rush town centre, local beaches and a wide range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants and schools. Rush & Lusk train station provides a regular commuter service to Dublin, with connections to the DART and Luas, while the 33/33X bus services provide further access to Dublin city centre. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport and Swords are all within easy driving distance.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised to fully appreciate the accommodation, versatility and potential this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nVT Link of Property 1: https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=MiLAbDVkv4p\r\n\r\nVT Link of Property 2: https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=eWScsAvagU8\r\n\r\nThese units have two separate BER ratings: \r\n\r\nProperty 1 is C Rated & Property 2 is B rated.\r\n\r\n***\r\n\r\n*All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.*"
      },
